exports[`guideToMarkdown > matches the snapshot 1`] = `
"# Gmail OAuth guide

https://mail.google.com · v1.0.0 · last verified 2026-10-20 · confidence medium · tier verified

## Do you need your own OAuth app?

**Composio managed:** yes (checked 2026-10-20). Composio-managed OAuth is available. You can start without your own OAuth app.

Bring your own app when:
- The consent screen must show your brand, not "Composio"
- You need custom scopes
- You need your own rate quota (managed apps share quota)
- You need polling faster than 15 minutes (the managed minimum)
- You connect to a custom or self-hosted instance
- Enterprise customers require your branding end-to-end
- Your agent needs gmail.modify with your own consent branding

UI fixture only. Not a published guide.

**Redirect URI:** Copy the callback URL from the Composio dashboard (Create Auth Config); don't hard-code it.

Switching to your own app affects new connections only. Existing connected accounts stay on the old auth config until users re-authenticate.

Sources:
- [Composio managed-auth directory](https://docs.composio.dev/toolkits/managed-auth)
- [Custom app vs. managed app](https://docs.composio.dev/docs/authentication/custom-app-vs-managed-app)
- [White-labeling authentication](https://docs.composio.dev/docs/authentication/white-labeling-authentication)

## Verdict

**Difficulty 5/5 — Very hard.** Testable today with 100 test users; restricted scopes need verification and an annual security assessment.

- CASA security assessment (annual) (security-assessment, weight 5)
- send-only path: 3/5 (Moderate)

- Approval model: scope verification
- Can test before approval: true

## Milestones

| Milestone | Definition | Hands-on | Wait | Basis |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| Dev-ready | You and up to 100 test users | 0.5–1 h | no wait | official-estimate |
| Pilot-ready | External users with sensitive scopes | 4–8 h | 3–10 days | community (reported by developers, not a commitment) |
| Production-ready | Any Google user, no unverified-app screen | 16–40 h | 30+ days | unknown |

Limits at Dev-ready:
- 100 test users; refresh tokens expire after 7 days _(primary)_ — https://support.google.com/cloud/answer/15549945

## Next actions

- **Create a Google Cloud project** (human) — done when: Project exists
- **Configure the consent screen** (both) — done when: Test user can authorize

## Blockers

- **high** (production-ready): Restricted scopes require an annual third-party assessment. Workaround: Use gmail.send only, or Composio-managed auth. _Agent can help._

## Before you start

- **Verified domain and privacy policy** (human, production-ready): Homepage and privacy policy on a domain you own.

## Gates

- **Testing mode: 100 test users, 7-day refresh tokens** (testing-cap; pilot-ready) — applies when: until the app is published
- **Sensitive scope verification (gmail.send)** (scope-review; production-ready) — applies when: sensitive scopes in production
- **Restricted scope verification** (scope-review; production-ready) — applies when: read/modify profile; duration: Several weeks _(secondary, reported by developers, not a commitment)_ — https://www.reddit.com/r/googlecloud/
- **CASA security assessment (annual)** (security-assessment; production-ready) — applies when: restricted Gmail scopes
- **Workspace admin allowlisting** (admin-consent; conditional, not scored) — applies when: customer Workspace blocks third-party apps

## Scopes

| Scope | Sensitivity | Why | Review trigger |
|---|---|---|---|
| \`https://www.googleapis.com/auth/gmail.modify\` | restricted | Read and label mail for the agent | Restricted scope verification and CASA |

## Setup steps

1. **Create a Google Cloud project** (create, human, ~5 min): Open the console; Create a project. Done when: Project exists
2. **Configure the consent screen** (configure, both): Set audience to External; Add test users. Done when: Test user can authorize

## OAuth configuration

- Redirect URIs: Exact match; https required except localhost _(primary)_
- PKCE: Supported _(tested probe)_
- Token lifetime: unknown
- Refresh: unknown
- Rate limits: unknown

## Agent vs. human

Agent:
- Draft scope justifications

Human:
- Record the demo video for verification

