## Evidence

- [ev-1] Restricted scopes require a security assessment — _primary, high_ — https://developers.google.com/identity/protocols/oauth2/production-readiness/restricted-scope-verification (2026-10-20)
  > security assessment

## Unknowns

- Exact CASA turnaround for a new tier-2 app
